   "reading_hi": "Surya rekha maujood hai — chumbakiya vyaktitva, logon par prabhav aur pehchan paane ki natural shakti. Yeh 'luck line' hai: jahan se yeh shuru hoti hai, wahan se zindagi mein roshni, samman aur avsar badhte jaate hain. Sun line (Apollo line) ki maujoodagi ek creative ya public-facing career ki taraf jhukav ka sanket deti hai. Yeh vyakti aksar apne kaam mein pehchaan paata hai, chahe woh kisi bhi field mein ho. Is energy ko sahi direction mein lagane se bahut achhe natije aa sakte hain. (2 classical sources is baat par sehmat hain.)",
