   "reading_hi": "Do-teen Surya rekhayein saath-saath samanantar chal rahi hain — do ya teen alag kshetron mein ek saath safalta ka yog. Multi-hyphenate hona aapke liye distraction nahi, design hai. Surya ki ungali ke pehle jod par ek jaisi rekhaen milna, samman aur daulat dono ka sanket deta hai. Yeh sthayi mehnat aur achhi kismat ka mel hai jo financial stability ki taraf le ja sakta hai. Aksar yeh log apne career mein izzat bhi kamahte hain aur paisa bhi.",
   "reading_en": null,
   "readingScope": "variation",
   "qualified": [
    {
     "ruleId": "PALM-DALE-160",
     "when": [
