       "value": "pink_red"
      }
     ],
     "text_hi": "Jab Sun line saaf, seedhi aur achhi tarah se coloured ho, yeh sanket deta hai ki aapko bade aur prabhavshali logon ka samarthan milega. Career mein izzat aur khushi ke mauke aksar aate hain aise haath mein. Yeh ek bahut shubh sanket hai."
    }
