   "reading_hi": "Jab Sun line katri-phati ya uneven ho, toh career ke raaste mein rukavaten aur dushmani ka samna ho sakta hai. Yeh koi tay shuda baat nahi hai — is par dhyan dekar aur sahi logon ka saath leke halat sudhare ja sakte hain. Yeh sthayi nahi hai. Jab Sun line confused ya afflicted dikhe, to yeh sanket deta hai ki powerful ya authoritative logon se tension ya virodh aa sakta hai. Yeh ek phase hai jo aata-jaata hai — is par kaam kiya ja sakta hai patience aur diplomacy se. Yeh sthayi nahi hai. Surya parvat par bahut si chhoti rekhayein — pratibha ek nahi, kai hain. Lekin yahi problem bhi hai: bahut saare ideas, bikhra hua focus. Niyam yaad rakho — ek saaf Surya rekha sau bikhri rekhaon se behtar hai. Ek chuno, use jitao, phir agla.",
